</code></pre> <pre><code>install -m 600 /dev/null ./control-plane.headers
printf 'Authorization: Bearer %s\n' "$GATEWAY_TOKEN" &gt; ./control-plane.headers

curl -s -X POST http://192.0.2.254:11111/netlox/v1/config/loadbalancer \
  -H @control-plane.headers \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "serviceArguments": { "externalIP": "192.0.2.254", "port": 8080,
                          "protocol": "tcp", "sel": 0, "mode": 4 },
    "endpoints": [ { "endpointIP": "198.51.100.11", "targetPort": 8000, "weight": 1 } ]
  }'
</code></pre> <pre><code>loxicmd create lb 192.0.2.254 --tcp=8080:8000 --endpoints=198.51.100.11:1 --mode=fullproxy
</code></pre> <p><code>mode: 4</code> is required for AI routing</p> <p>Fullproxy mode (<code>mode=4</code>) is the prerequisite for all AI routing features.</p>
